  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何見てるんだ？　智代子",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007400050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ひゃあああっ！？　プロデューサーさん！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_fear",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100740/4901007400050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "す、すまん……！\r\nそんなに驚かれるとは思ってなくて……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007400060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ああっ、とんでもないです、すみません！\r\n私が勝手にビクビクしちゃっただけで……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100740/4901007400060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007400070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えへへ……！\r\n見てたのはお菓子のレシピでした……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100740/4901007400070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、そうなんだな……\r\n──おっ、やっぱりチョコのお菓子か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007400080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……はい、今度作ろうかなって思ってたんですけど\r\nでも──……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100740/4901007400080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007400090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──え？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100740/4901007400090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子のお菓子は美味しいからさ\r\nもらえる人は嬉しいだろうなと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007400100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……い、いっつもチョコでも……\r\n飽きないですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100740/4901007400100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺だったら絶対飽きない\r\nこの間食べさせてもらったのだって美味しかったし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──あっ！　別にねだってるとかじゃないからな！？\r\n気は遣わなくて大丈夫だぞ……！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007400110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──あはは！　はいっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
